      "Text": "Security update for git-annex",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for git-annex fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in git-annex:\n\n- CVE-2026-112818: Fix cross-repository data exfiltration (bsc#1288146)\n\n- Touch tmp/configure-stamp after building so that the Makefile does\n  not reconfigure with its own flags, discarding the ones above, and\n  rebuild the binary during %install/%check.\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
